data: {"id": "7c2348f091c44020-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "7c2348f091c44020", "seq": 820, "ts_ms": 1789105588924, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 30.474, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v01", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/7c2348f091c44020-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "de9cc9e0162e2d3ab9fda28c0fdaa3a292c668412debdea65b41350ab663f3d7", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "247b1e0474deda24a009c38da31976e7dd2422c707ad3a4237b4ab6c8ee3410c"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "7c2348f091c44020-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "7c2348f091c44020", "seq": 821, "ts_ms": 1789105588924, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "7c2348f091c44020-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "7c2348f091c44020", "seq": 822, "ts_ms": 1789105594042, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 5.118, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1005, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | 集群 CPU 总容量不足 (Insufficient cpu)，且无可抢占资源 (No preemption victims)，导致 default-scheduler 无法将 Pod 调度至任何节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found` | 明确说明所有 3 个节点均缺乏 CPU 资源，且调度器因无可抢占目标而放弃尝试 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `Unschedulable (0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu...)` | 记录 Pod 最终调度失败状态，与 Event 事实一致 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.cpu` | `100k` | 确认 Pod 请求的 CPU 资源量，证明非资源配置缺失导致的调度失败 |\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\n集群 3 个节点 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器触发抢占机制但无可抢占目标 → Pod 保持 Unschedulable (Pending) 状态 → 无法分配到节点\n```\n\n**根因结论**\n已确认根因为集群 CPU 容量不足。所有 3 个可用节点均报告 `Insufficient cpu`，且调度器因找不到任何可抢占的工作负载（`No preemption victims`），导致 Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload` 无法满足调度要求并保持 `Pending` 状态（见证据 1, 2）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | 集群 CPU 总容量不足 (Insufficient cpu)，且无可抢占资源 (No preemption victims)，导致 default-scheduler 无法将 Pod 调度至任何节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found` | 明确说明所有 3 个节点均缺乏 CPU 资源，且调度器因无可抢占目标而放弃尝试 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `Unschedulable (0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu...)` | 记录 Pod 最终调度失败状态，与 Event 事实一致 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.cpu` | `100k` | 确认 Pod 请求的 CPU 资源量，证明非资源配置缺失导致的调度失败 |\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\n集群 3 个节点 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器触发抢占机制但无可抢占目标 → Pod 保持 Unschedulable (Pending) 状态 → 无法分配到节点\n```\n\n**根因结论**\n已确认根因为集群 CPU 容量不足。所有 3 个可用节点均报告 `Insufficient cpu`，且调度器因找不到任何可抢占的工作负载（`No preemption victims`），导致 Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload` 无法满足调度要求并保持 `Pending` 状态（见证据 1, 2）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

